88608618926,'Sep 5, 2026','2026-10-11 16:20:06','2026-10-20 08:00:01','[]',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]'),('1788608737175','NBA Imposes Historic Punishment on the Clippers and Steve Ballmer in Salary Cap Scandal','1788608737175','The league fined the franchise $30 million and stripped it of five first-round draft picks for ‘flagrant violations’ of salary-cap rules to pay superstar Kawhi Leonard.','The NBA on Wednesday delivered one of the harshest penalties in league history to the Los Angeles Clippers, owned by Steve Ballmer, for what it called a “flagra...','<figure style=\"float: left; margin: 8px 24px 16px 0px; width: 450px; clear: left; max-width: 100%;\"><img src=\"/api/webp-proxy?url=https%3A%2F%2Ff005.backblazeb2.com%2Ffile%2Ftimeschicago%2Farticles%2Farticle_1788608737175_img_1788608740122_0.webp\" alt=\"Article image\" style=\"width: 100%; border-radius: 12px;\" data-webp-converted=\"true\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-top: 6px; font-family: sans-serif; width: 100%;\"></div></figure><p data-type=\"paragraph\" class=\"css-1qg6i2u e1hwu21o0\" style=\"--summary-font-color: #555555; --summary-bullet-small-font-color: #222222; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); direction: ltr; font-family: Exchange, Georgia, serif; line-height: calc(1.55556); margin: 0px 0px 1em; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: &quot;Encorpada Classic Compressed Bold&quot;, &quot;Escrow Display Condensed Bold&quot;, &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, &quot;Playfair Display Fallback&quot;, &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, Georgia, serif;\">&nbsp;</span>The NBA on Wednesday delivered one of the harshest penalties in league history to the <a data-type=\"place\" href=\"https://www.wsj.com/topics/place/los-angeles\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ekxajjj0 css-i0lbhy-OverridedLink\" style=\"display: inline; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); text-decoration: none; transition-property: color, fill; transition-duration: 200ms, 200ms; t