age\" style=\"width: 100%; border-radius: 12px;\" data-webp-converted=\"true\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-top: 6px; font-family: sans-serif; width: 100%;\"></div></figure><p class=\"emoyrq42 e1bc1vag0 css-1uzoyz5-StyledNewsKitParagraph\" data-type=\"paragraph\" data-testid=\"paragraph\" style=\"--summary-font-color: #555555; --summary-bullet-small-font-color: #222222; margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Exchange, Georgia, serif; font-stretch: normal; margin-block-end: 16px; word-break: break-word; line-height: calc(1.55556);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: &quot;Encorpada Classic Compressed Bold&quot;, &quot;Escrow Display Condensed Bold&quot;, &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, &quot;Playfair Display Fallback&quot;, &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, Georgia, serif;\">&nbsp;</span>Ever since they started the hottest brand in the frozen aisle, the founders of JonnyPops have measured progress through a series of firsts.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"emoyrq42 e1bc1vag0 css-1uzoyz5-StyledNewsKitParagraph\" data-type=\"paragraph\" data-testid=\"paragraph\" style=\"--summary-font-color: #555555; --summary-bullet-small-font-color: #222222; margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Exchange, Georgia, serif; font-stretch: normal; margin-block-end: 16px; word-break: break-word; line-height: calc(1.55556);\">There was the first employee they kept during the winter, the company’s first invitation to the almighty <a data-type=\"place\" href=\"https://www.wsj.com/topics/place/minnesota\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ekxajjj0 css-i0lbhy-OverridedLink\" style=\"display: inline; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); text-decoration: none; transition-property: color, fill; transition-duration: 200ms, 200ms; transition-timing-function: cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.5, 1), cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.5, 1); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(34, 34, 34);\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Minnesota</a> State Fair, the first time they watched